### 🟢 LOW SEVERITY

#### 9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)
**Academic name:** General Fixture (Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020)
**Scope:** Class-level `[TestInitialize]` (line 13)

```csharp
private FakeLogger _logger = null!;
// initialized in Setup but used by 0 of 8 tests
```

**Risk:** Every test pays the cost of creating `_logger` even though none use it. As the class grows, unused fixtures accumulate and obscure what each test actually needs.

**Fix:** Remove `_logger` from the shared setup. Add it only to tests that need it:
```csharp
// Remove from class fields and [TestInitialize]
// Add locally when needed:
var logger = new FakeLogger();
var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory, logger);
```

